 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From Tirzah he went up the road",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Samaria, with a heavy load",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He struck down Shallum, son of Jabesh",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And took the throne for himself, the least",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Menahem son of Gadi reigned",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the thirty-ninth year, unchanged",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did what was evil in the Lord's sight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holding power by might and rite",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tiphsah refused to open its gate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he attacked, sealing its fate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He ripped open all the pregnant women",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A brutal end for their broken homes",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Menahem son of Gadi reigned",
